{"title": "Shoe Slinger", "pageid": 28422, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Shoe_Slinger", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Bugs", "Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<p><b>Shoe Slinger</b> is a passive feature that allows the shoes to be thrown at an enemy.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>Returns to its owner when thrown. On a hit deal an additional <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">2d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Psychic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">Psychic</span></a> damage. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Slinging_Shoes\" title=\"Slinging Shoes\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/34/Slinging_Shoes_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Slinging_Shoes_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/34/Slinging_Shoes_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Slinging_Shoes_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/34/Slinging_Shoes_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Slinging_Shoes_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/34/Slinging_Shoes_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Slinging_Shoes_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/34/Slinging_Shoes_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Slinging_Shoes\" title=\"Slinging Shoes\">Slinging Shoes</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Much like other <a href=\"/wiki/Homing_Weapons\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Homing Weapons\">Homing Weapons</a>, an item with Shoe Slinger automatically equips itself onto the thrower when it returns. If the thrower has other <a href=\"/wiki/Footwear\" title=\"Footwear\">footwear</a> equipped when throwing the Slinging Shoes, it is unequipped in favour of them.</li>\n<li>This <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">2d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Psychic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">Psychic</span></a> bonus damage is dealt when thrown even on miss.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>The <span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">2d4</span>⁠<span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Psychic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">Psychic</span></a> damage is not dealt if thrown via <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Enraged_Throw\" title=\"Enraged Throw\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Enraged_Throw_Icon.webp/20px-Enraged_Throw_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Enraged_Throw_Icon.webp/30px-Enraged_Throw_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/cf/Enraged_Throw_Icon.webp/40px-Enraged_Throw_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Enraged Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/cf/Enraged_Throw_Icon.webp/20px-Enraged_Throw_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/c/cf/Enraged_Throw_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Enraged_Throw\" title=\"Enraged Throw\">Enraged Throw</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200133\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.047 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.053 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1927/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 17409/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 7322/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 25/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.012/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 971570/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   45.280      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   45.280      1 -total\n 34.25%   15.507      3 Template:DamageText\n 32.69%   14.800      4 Template:Icon_link\n 31.56%   14.290      4 Template:Icon_text\n 30.91%   13.994     29 Template:Trim\n 30.00%   13.584      3 Template:Damage_type\n 24.10%   10.912      1 Template:Passive_equipment_list\n 19.92%    9.018      6 Template:Ifempty\n 18.81%    8.518      1 Template:Passive_sources/format\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:28422-0!canonical and timestamp 20260714200133 and revision id 392916. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}